1
00:00:00,201 --> 00:00:03,331
...his name is gonna be Scrap Metal.

2
00:00:03,496 --> 00:00:05,536
(Leonard:)Come on. Is that really necessary?

3
00:00:05,707 --> 00:00:07,207
(Sheldon:)Leonard, I believe it is.

4
00:00:07,375 --> 00:00:08,915
(Sheldon:)This is trash talk.

5
00:00:09,085 --> 00:00:11,545
(Sheldon:)Trash talk is a traditional component
in all sporting events.

6
00:00:11,713 --> 00:00:12,713
[CLEARS THROAT]

7
00:00:14,048 --> 00:00:15,588
(Leonard:)Kripke...

8
00:00:15,758 --> 00:00:19,138
(Sheldon:)...your robot is inferior
and it will be defeated by ours...

9
00:00:19,304 --> 00:00:23,344
(Sheldon:)...because ours exceeds yours
in both design and execution.

10
00:00:24,309 --> 00:00:27,729
(Sheldon:)Also, I'm given to understand
that your mother is overweight.

11
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:32,770
(Raj:)Oh, snap.

12
00:00:33,193 --> 00:00:36,113
